{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2023-03-09 14:39:00', 'title': "INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE RESPONDS TO THE FTC'S ATTEMPT TO BLOCK ICE'S ACQUISITION OF BLACK KNIGHT", 'text': "ATLANTA & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT STRONGLY DISAGREES WITH, AND WILL VIGOROUSLY OPPOSE, THE FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION (FTC)'S CHALLENGE TO ICE'S PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF BLACK KNIGHT, INC. (NYSE: BKI)."}